        <mxCell id="an-triple" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontFamily=LXGW WenKai TC;fontColor=#E8590C;" value="Attribution triple recorded in run/start: harness_state_version + projector_version + arm_id.&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;Omitting projector_version is the subtlest failure available: improving a fold reducer silently changes recomputed historical metrics, so last month&#39;s A/B conclusion quietly stops holding. A projector being pure does not make it stable across versions.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="1520" x="40" y="1100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t-d" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=LXGW WenKai TC;fontColor=#6741D9;" value="D. One example, three views — the same log projected to a DAG and then to planner context. Note that completion order (seq) and context order (vertex_id) deliberately disagree." vertex="1">
