        <mxCell id="d-cmp" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFEC99;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=2;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=LXGW WenKai TC;strokeColor=#F08C00;fontColor=#F08C00;" value="Ordering: b2 &lt; b7 lexicographically, so v-b2 comes first —&#xa;even though v-b7 finished first (seq 18 &lt; seq 21).&#xa;Sorting by seq would emit ③ before ② on this run and&#xa;possibly ② before ③ on the next, for identical business facts." vertex="1">
