        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontFamily=LXGW WenKai TC;fontColor=#1971C2;" value="Why vertex_id and never seq: v-b2 and v-b7 are parallel siblings with no dependency between them, so seq only records which HTTP response arrived first — network jitter, not business meaning.&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;Ordering context by seq would make the same facts produce different prompts across runs, breaking replay determinism (a recorded log would no longer match) and destroying prompt-cache prefix stability. Lexicographic vertex_id is arbitrary but stable, which is exactly what is required.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="1520" x="40" y="1540" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
